			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-944988">
									

<p>It's a satellite that transmits data to an unknown destination - which is almost certainly within a matter of a couple of lightyears tops, else EM transmission would be far too slow to matter. And every attempt to attack the thing, or even investigate it closely, has resulted in the destruction of the device used. This includes two groundside computers that had no physical linkage with the item in question.</p>
<p>Somehow I doubt it can be so easily destroyed as all that. And even if it could be, would the Foundation not be mightily interested in who is gathering all this information, <em>and why?</em></p>

