			<div class="content" id="post-content-945022">
									

<p>The existence of many satellites is quite classified, in fact! In particular, I imagine, Foundation ones. As are precise warhead counts. We're often fed a ballpark figure, but this thing seems to know with considerably more precision.</p>
<p>There's also the matter of the Foundation only having been able to decipher a tiny, tiny portion of the total transmission. It's beaming god knows what out to god knows who, and in large amounts. Would it help you be more concerned if there was some suggestion of it sending SCP-sensitive info, too?</p>
